$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. c)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-(4-ethylphenyl)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9d) yield: 84%, reaction time: 8d, ee: 80%. [α]D24 = +3.9° (c = 1.03,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(400 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.21 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 3 H, H11),
1.53 (m, 4 H, H18, H19), 1.62 (m, 2 H, H18'), 2.61 (q, J = 7.5 Hz, 2 H,
H10), 2.67 (dd, J = 6.5, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.36 (m, 2 H, H17), 3.57 (m, 2
H, H17'), 3.68 (s, 3 H, H16), 4.40 (t, J = 6.5 Hz, 1 H, H5), 6.25 (d, J =
15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.47 (m, 2 H, H13), 6.68 (m, 2 H, H14), 6.74 (td, J =
7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.14 (d, J = 8.0 Hz, 2 H, H8), 7.25 (d, J = 8.0
Hz, 2 H, H7). 13C-NMR(100 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 15.41 (C11), 24.50
(C19), 25.43 (C18), 26.56 (C18'), 28.37 (C10), 41.42 (C4), 42.98 (C17),
46.81 (C17'), 55.60 (C16), 57.54 (C5), 114.6 (C13), 114.7 (C14), 123.7
(C2), 126.3 (C7), 128.0 (C8), 140.1 (C9), 140.6 (C3), 141.2 (C12), 142.9
(C6), 152.0 (C15), 165.0 (C1). IR (Film): ν (cm-1) = 3341, 2936, 2856,
1727, 1657, 1613, 1512, 1441, 1352, 1238, 1180, 1139, 1125, 1041, 976,
877, 820, 787, 716, 549. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 205 (4.592), 245
(4.301), 312 (3.477). HR-MS (ESI): calcd. for C25H33N2O2 ([M+H]+):
393.25365; found: 393.25379. calcd. for C25H32N2O2Na ([M+Na]+):
415.23560; found: 415.23576. calcd. for C50H65N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 785.50003;
found: 785.50062. calcd. for C50H64N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 807.48198; found:
807.48183. HPLC: Chiralcel OD column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1,
flow rate 1.0 ml/min, UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 12.6
min (9d), minor enantiomer tr = 22.6 min (ent-9d).
