$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Our synthesis began with a titanium-mediated Mukaiyama aldol reaction
under chelation control using the tetrasubstituted enoxysilane 7 and
aldehyde 12 derived from (S)-Roche ester (Scheme 3). The β-hydroxy esters
having a tertiary bromide at C2 were isolated in good yield and excellent
3,4- anti selectivity.
