Aromatic, and Heterocyclic Aldehydes and Trifluoromethyl Phenyl Ketone
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Chintareddy, Venkat Reddy; Wadhwa, Kuldeep; Verkade, John G.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2009), 74(21), 8118-8132

