$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 2) General Procedure for Vinylogous Mannich
Reactions Preparation of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidin-1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one
(9b) An oven-dried, 10-mL flask containing a solution of 42.3 mg (0.20
mmol, 1.0 equiv) of (E)- N-benzylidene-4-methoxyaniline (1b) and 1.70 mg
(0.002 mmol, 0.01 equiv) of chiral phosphoric acid (4b) in 2.0 mL of a
freshly prepared solvent mixture (iPrOH, tBuOH, 2- Me- 2-BuOH 1:1:1 and
1.0 eq H2O) was cooled to - 30°C. After one minute 160 mg (0.60 mmol, 3.0
equiv.) (Z)-1-[1-(tert-Butyldimethylsilanyloxy)-1,3-butadienyl]piperidine
(5d) was added dropwise. The resulting mixture was stirred rapidly for 7
days whereupon the solvent was removed in vacuo. The residue was purified
by silica gel chromatography (diethyl ether/petroleum ether, 8/1) to
afford 72 mg (99%; 90% ee) of
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-5-phenyl-1-(piperidine-
1-yl)pent-2-en-1-one (9b) as a colorless oil. h)
(2E,5R)-5-(4-methoxyphenylamino)-1-(piperidin-1-yl)-5-m-tolylpent-2-en-1-one
(9i) yield: 82%, reaction time: 3d, ee: 92%. [α]D24 = -13.4° (c = 1.04,
CHCl3). 1H-NMR(200 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d = 1.52-1.64 (m, 6 H, H19, H19',
H20), 2.33 (s, 3 H, H12), 2.67 (dd, J = 7.0, 7.0 Hz, 2 H, H4), 3.37 (m, 2
H, H18), 3.57 (m, 2 H, H18'), 3.69 (s, 3 H, H17), 4.37 (t, J = 7.0 Hz, 1
H, H5), 6.27 (d, J = 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H2), 6.47 (m, 2 H, H14), 6.68 (m, 2 H,
H15), 6.75 (td, J = 7.0, 15.0 Hz, 1 H, H3), 7.03 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1 H,
H9), 7.12-7.24 (m, 3 H, H7, H8, H11). 13C-NMR(50 MHz, CDCl3, 26°C): d =
21.47 (C12), 24.52 (C20), 25.47 (C19), 26.56 (C19'), 41.48 (C4), 43.00
(C18), 46.83 (C18'), 55.63 (C17), 57.78 (C5), 114.6 (C14), 114.7 (C15),
123.4 (C7), 123.7 (C2), 127.0 (C9), 127.9 (C8), 128.4 (C11), 138.1 (C10),
140.5 (C3), 141.2 (C13), 143.1 (C6), 152.0 (C16), 164.9 (C1). IR (Film):
ν (cm-1) = 3341, 2998, 2937, 2856, 1727, 1656, 1608, 1512, 1441, 1367,
1350, 1236, 1180, 1139, 1126, 1103, 1078, 1040, 975, 852, 820, 787, 705,
521, 447. UV (MeCN): λmax (lg (ε)) = 246 (4.353), 313 (3.503). HR-MS
(ESI): calcd. for C24H31N2O2 ([M+H]+): 379.23800; found: 379.23812.
calcd. for C24H30N2O2Na ([M+Na]+): 401.21995; found: 401.22001. calcd.
for C48H61N4O4 ([2M+H]+): 757.46873; found: 757.46949. calcd. for
C48H60N4O4Na ([2M+Na]+): 779.45068; found: 779.45018. HPLC: Chiralcel OD
column, solvent: n-hexane/i-propanol 4/1, flow rate: 1.0 ml/min,
UVdetection at 250 nm, major enantiomer tr = 14.0 min (9i), minor
enantiomer tr = 22.0 min (ent- 9i).
