$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: 3.2. Diastereoselective Mukaiyama aldol
reaction of cyclohexanones with acyclic ketene acetals Ethyl
(1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)acetate (4a) Ethyl
2-((1R*,2R*)-2-allyl-1-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)cyclohexyl)-2-methylpropanoate
(4g) According to the synthetic procedure for 4a, this compound was
obtained in 81% yield (299.3 mg, 0.81 mmol) by the reaction of
2-allylcyclohexanone 2c (149 μL, 1.0 mmol) with
tert-butyl(1-ethoxy-2-methylpropenyloxy)-dimethylsilane (345.6 mg, 1.5
mmol) in CH2Cl2 (2.0 mL) in the presence of Tf2CHCH2CHTf2 1 (8.6 mg, 15
μmol) for 1.5 h at -178 °C, then for 1 h at -124 °C. Colorless oil;. IR
(neat) ν 2951, 2932, 2857, 1724, 1254, 1141, 1085, 1043, 834, 771 cm-1;
1H NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 0.19 (3H, s), 0.20 (3H, s), 0.96 (9H, s),
1.07-1.18 (1H, m), 1.23-1.35 (2H, m), 1.26 (3H, t, J = 7.1 Hz), 1.29 (3H,
s), 1.32 (3H, s), 1.42-1.51 (1H, m), 1.51-1.79 (6H, m), 1.85 (1H, dt, J =
14.1, 9.4 Hz), 4.02-4.21 (2H, m), 4.92-5.00 (2H, m), 5.69-5.78 (1H, m);
13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ -11.3 and -11.2, 14.1, 20.0, 21.8, 23.7, 24.2
and 24.4, 26.8, 27.5, 33.7, 36.1, 43.1, 52.7, 60.4, 81.4, 115.1, 138.7,
177.2; MS (ESI-TOF) m/z 391 [M+Na]+; HRMS calcd for C21H40NaO3Si [M+Na]+,
391.2644; found, 391.2637.
