$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Jankowska, Joanna; Mlynarski, Jacek
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2006), 71(4), 1317-1321

